# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — KIDSPARK
## Create a Real, Production-Oriented Child Growth & Future Skills Application

You are an expert full-stack software engineer, UI/UX architect, Firebase developer, AI integration engineer, child-development content designer, and application security specialist.

Your mission is to build **KIDSPARK**, a premium, mobile-first, parent-controlled application for families with children aged 1–10.

**Brand name:** KIDSPARK  
**Tagline:** Raise Their Potential, One Day at a Time.  
**Product category:** Parenting, child development, family organization, education, future skills.

This is NOT a static website, landing-page-only project, fake dashboard, or clickable prototype.

Build a real application with functioning screens, persistent data, real authentication, working forms, interconnected features, a secure backend, and thoughtful user experiences.

Use an incremental development approach, but implement as much of the complete working application as possible. Do not silently replace requested functionality with nonfunctional mockups.

